# Elastic response of perfect bcc Fe (Mendelev 2003 #2) to an extra xz box tilt, in the screw-cell frame.
# Frame: x = [111], y = [-110], z = [-1-12]; fully periodic; a = 2.8553 A.
# Box set in Angstrom from the true repeats a*sqrt3, a*sqrt2, a*sqrt6 (as in sims/01_screw_cell/build.py): 5 x 10 x 4.
# (LAMMPS 'units lattice' spacing along [-1-12] is 2/3 of the repeat, which gave a non-periodic, pre-stressed box.)
# A tilt xz = gamma*Lz gives u_x = gamma*z, i.e. engineering shear strain gamma_xz = gamma.
# Sign convention: LAMMPS pressure P_ij = -sigma_ij (stress, tension positive), in bar; 1 GPa = 10000 bar.
# Usage: lmp -in in.tilt -var gamma 0.005
units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic
lattice         bcc 2.8553 orient x 1 1 1 orient y -1 1 0 orient z -1 -1 2
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 4.9455247 4.038004 4.6626854
variable        a equal 2.8553
region          box prism 0 $(5*v_a*sqrt(3)) 0 $(10*v_a*sqrt(2)) 0 $(4*v_a*sqrt(6)) 0 0 0 units box
region          box prism 0 24.727623354257076471 0 $(10*v_a*sqrt(2)) 0 $(4*v_a*sqrt(6)) 0 0 0 units box
region          box prism 0 24.727623354257076471 0 40.380039846438990025 0 $(4*v_a*sqrt(6)) 0 0 0 units box
region          box prism 0 24.727623354257076471 0 40.380039846438990025 0 27.976112250275232185 0 0 0 units box
create_box      1 box
Created triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (24.727623 40.38004 27.976112) with tilt (0 0 0)
  1 by 7 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 2400 atoms
  using lattice units in triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (24.727623 40.38004 27.976112) with tilt (0 0 0)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass            1 55.845
pair_style      eam/fs
pair_coeff      * * ../../potentials/Fe_mm.eam.fs Fe
Reading eam/fs potential file ../../potentials/Fe_mm.eam.fs with DATE: 2007-06-11
variable        Lz equal lz
compute         dist all pair/local dist
compute         dmin all reduce min c_dist inputs local
thermo_style    custom step pe c_dmin
run             0
